sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Developer
    participant UI as React Frontend (App.tsx)
    participant Client as ApiClient (client.ts)
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Router (v1)
    participant Service as GeneratorService
    participant Engine as GenerationPipeline
    participant DB as Database (PostgreSQL / SQLite)

    User->>UI: Types query "1968" in ProblemSearch
    UI->>Client: searchProblems("1968")
    Client->>FastAPI: GET /api/v1/problems?query=1968
    FastAPI->>DB: ProblemRepository.search(query="1968")
    DB-->>FastAPI: Return ProblemSummary matching slug
    FastAPI-->>Client: 200 OK [PaginatedResponse]
    Client-->>UI: Update search autocomplete dropdown

    User->>UI: Selects "array-with-elements-not-equal-to-average-of-neighbors"
    UI->>Client: getProblem("array-with-elements-not-equal-to-average-of-neighbors")
    Client->>FastAPI: GET /api/v1/problems/{slug}
    FastAPI->>DB: ProblemRepository.get_by_slug(slug)
    DB-->>FastAPI: Problem record + constraints + schema
    FastAPI-->>Client: 200 OK [ProblemDetail]
    Client-->>UI: Render ProblemCard & CategorySelector

    User->>UI: Adjusts categories (Boundary, Structural, Extremes) & Clicks "Generate"
    UI->>UI: Set generating=true (show active spinner)
    UI->>Client: generateTestCases(slug, {count: 10, categories, seed: 42})
    Client->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/problems/{slug}/generate
    FastAPI->>FastAPI: Pydantic Validate (1 <= count <= 20)

    alt Unsupported Schema (e.g., TreeNode / ListNode)
        FastAPI->>Engine: ProblemRegistry.check_support(slug, schema)
        Engine-->>FastAPI: Raise UnsupportedProblemFormatException
        FastAPI-->>Client: 422 Unprocessable Entity (UNSUPPORTED_FORMAT)
        Client-->>UI: Display informative ErrorState callout
    else Supported Schema
        FastAPI->>Service: generate_for_problem(slug, request)
        Service->>Engine: GenerationPipeline.run(...)
        Engine->>Engine: Synthesize candidates across requested categories
        Engine->>Engine: SchemaValidator.validate_input (Filter violations)
        Engine->>Engine: Deduplicator.filter_unique (SHA-256)
        Engine->>Engine: ProblemOracle.evaluate (Truthful verification)
        Engine->>Engine: LeetCodeRawFormatter.format_input & format_batch
        Engine-->>Service: Return structured candidates & raw_batch_input
        Service->>DB: TestCaseRepository.log_generation_run(...)
        Service-->>FastAPI: GenerateResponse
        FastAPI-->>Client: 200 OK [GenerateResponse]
        Client-->>UI: Update testCases state & clear spinner
        User->>UI: Clicks "Copy All for LeetCode (Raw)"
        UI->>User: Writes batch string to clipboard & shows "Copied!" toast
    end
